prompt_template:
Design a finished experimental editorial poster. It must feel like an intimate photographic specimen partially erased and annotated, not a generic infographic.
{STYLE_FIDELITY_ANCHORS}
Subject: {SUBJECT}
Specific erasure: {ERASURE}
Exact annotations and positions: {LABELS}
Small title exactly: {MAIN_TEXT}
Composition: {DESIGN_DIRECTION}
Use no text other than the small title and specified labels. Labels bold lowercase compact grotesk; no arrows or leaders. Fine-to-medium analog gray grain confined to the retained photo and 3-5 residual small gray photographic squares; white paper stays almost clean. Thin irregular black traced outer contour with occasional breaks, no ornate internal drawing. Black/white/gray only. Do not fill the absent region with a faint photo: it must be solid white interrupted only by labels, contour and sparse small squares. Exclude source content: {SOURCE_CONTENT_TO_AVOID}.
